EXPECT_EXIT | 2 | NEGATIVE-bankruptcy-is-refused-while-selling-and-mortgaging-could-still-pay
EXPECT_OUT | you can still pay | NEGATIVE-says-why
RUN | $HOUSE/@.apps/deskopoly/ops/+x/deskopoly.+x | $T/app | $T/p | pay_debt
EXPECT_EXIT | 2 | NEGATIVE-pay-debt-with-too-little-cash-is-refused
